  norm_num only [basis00, basis01, basis02, basis03, basis04, basis05, basis06, basis07, basis08, basis09, basis10, basis11, basis12, basis13, basis14, basis15, basis16, basis17, basis18, basis19, basis20, basis21, basis22, basis23, basis24, basis25, basis26, basis27, basis28, basis29, basis30, basis31, basis32, basis33, basis34, basis35, basis36, basis37, basis38, basis39, basis40, basis41, basis42, basis43, basis44, basis45, basis46, basis47, basis48, basis49, basis50, basis51, basis52,
